---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Cybex Precision Gunworx delivers competition-ready centerfire and rimfire rifles — professionally assembled, test-fired, zeroed, and in stock for immediate shipment to your FFL."
  ogImage="/images/tool-room.webp"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "AboutPage",
        "name": "About Cybex Precision Gunworx",
        "url": "https://cybexprecisiongunworx.com/about/",
        "mainEntity": { "@id": "https://cybexprecisiongunworx.com/#business" }
      },
      {
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "itemListElement": [
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://cybexprecisiongunworx.com/" },
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About Us", "item": "https://cybexprecisiongunworx.com/about/" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  })} />
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>About Us</span>
      </div>
      <h1>About Cybex Precision Gunworx</h1>
      <p>Competition-ready rifles — without the delays or guesswork.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Origin Story -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-image">
          <img src="/images/tool-room.webp" alt="Cybex Precision Gunworx tool room with workbench, gunsmithing tools, and a precision rifle on a tripod" loading="lazy" width="1448" height="1086" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-content">
          <span class="label" style="display:inline-block;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cpg-accent);margin-bottom:var(--space-md);">Our Story</span>
          <h2>Precision Is Pursued. <br>Not Discovered.</h2>
          <p>
            Precision shooting isn’t something you simply discover—it’s something you deliberately pursue. At Cybex Precision Gunworx, that pursuit began with a common frustration: attempting to compete at a high level using equipment that wasn’t built for it.
          </p>
          <p>
            Like many shooters, I found that off-the-shelf rifles often fell short in delivering the consistency, repeatability, and refinement required for true performance—whether in centerfire or rimfire disciplines. While custom builds offered a solution, they introduced their own challenges: extended lead times, fragmented “à la carte” decisions, and uncertainty about how individual components would ultimately perform together.
          </p>
          <p style="color: var(--cpg-light); font-weight: 600;">
            That gap is exactly why this company exists.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">Our Process</span>
        <h2>Built as a System. Ready to Compete.</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto var(--space-3xl);">
        <p style="color: var(--cpg-silver); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Our process is built around a single objective: to deliver competition-ready rifles without the delays or guesswork. Each rifle is thoughtfully configured using proven, high-performance components—from precision actions and match-grade barrels to carefully selected stocks or chassis systems. For rimfire platforms, we incorporate tuners to achieve measurable performance gains. Optics are selected as an integrated part of the system, ensuring complete synergy rather than serving as an afterthought.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--cpg-silver); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Every rifle is professionally assembled, test-fired, and zeroed prior to shipment. The result is simple: when your rifle arrives, it isn’t just complete—it’s ready to perform. Each package also includes an optional Arken scope and custom-cut foam case tailored specifically to your setup, providing immediate protection for your investment.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--cpg-silver); line-height: 1.8;">
          Equally important, these are not made-to-order builds with extended timelines. Every rifle is in stock and available for immediate shipment to your FFL dealer, eliminating months of waiting and uncertainty.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Integrated Components</h3>
          <p>Precision actions, match-grade barrels, stocks or chassis, rimfire tuners, and optics chosen to work together as one system.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Test-Fired &amp; Zeroed</h3>
          <p>Every rifle is professionally assembled, test-fired, and zeroed before it ships—ready to perform out of the case.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Custom-Cut Foam Case</h3>
          <p>Each package includes a case cut specifically for your setup, protecting your investment from day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>In Stock, Ships Now</h3>
          <p>No made-to-order timelines. Every rifle is available for immediate shipment to your FFL dealer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Rifle Wall -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">The Lineup</span>
        <h2>Rimfire &amp; Centerfire, Ready on the Wall</h2>
        <p>From laminated benchrest rimfires to chassis-built PRS rifles, every build here is configured, tested, and waiting for its owner.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="rifle-wall">
        <img src="/images/rifle-wall.webp" alt="Wall of Cybex Precision Gunworx rifles: laminated-stock rimfire benchrest rifles on the left and chassis-built centerfire and rimfire precision rifles on the right, under the Cybex logo" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="768" />
        <figcaption>
          <span>Every rifle is assembled, test-fired, and zeroed before it ships.</span>
          <a href="/ready-to-ship/" class="btn btn-primary">See What's In Stock →</a>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px; text-align: center;">
      <span class="label" style="display:inline-block;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cpg-accent);margin-bottom:var(--space-md);">Our Mission</span>
      <blockquote style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem); line-height: 1.3; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl); padding-left: 0; border: none;">
        At its core, this is about removing barriers between you and <span style="color: var(--cpg-accent);">performance.</span>
      </blockquote>
      <p style="color: var(--cpg-silver); line-height: 1.8;">
        Whether you’re entering the world of precision shooting or striving for tighter groups and stronger match results, our mission is clear: deliver rifles that are ready to compete the moment they reach your hands.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section section-darker" style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">Ready to Compete?</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--cpg-silver); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); max-width: 500px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        Browse our in-stock, competition-ready rifles or reach out with questions about the right setup for you.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-md); justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/shop/" class="btn btn-primary">Shop Rifles →</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-outline">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .rifle-wall {
    max-width: 1024px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--cpg-border);
    background: var(--cpg-charcoal);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }
  .rifle-wall img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    transition: transform 0.8s ease;
  }
  .rifle-wall:hover img { transform: scale(1.02); }
  .rifle-wall figcaption {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--cpg-accent);
    background: var(--cpg-charcoal);
    color: var(--cpg-light);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .rifle-wall figcaption { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
